# Manual API requests for the REST Client VS Code extension (humao.rest-client).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Upload a document; point the `<` line at any PDF, JPEG or PNG (path is relative to this file)
# @name upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
--boundary--

### Upload the bundled 2-page PDF with text; the worker saves one `document_pages` row per page (see apps/worker/README.md)
# @name uploadTextPdf
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="text.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./samples/text.pdf
--boundary--

### List documents, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents

### Get the document from the last upload request
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{upload.response.body.$.id}}

### Get the text of the PDF from the "Upload the bundled 2-page PDF" request, one entry per page; empty until the worker has run
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{uploadTextPdf.response.body.$.id}}/pages

### Get a document that does not exist, to see an error response
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
